      "filename": "David Livingstone by Thomas Annan.jpg",
      "title": "File:David Livingstone by Thomas Annan.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/David_Livingstone_by_Thomas_Annan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
